{!Contact.FirstName},

Please allow me to extend a warm welcome on behalf of Advanced Technology Group (ATG).  It's great having you become a part of our ATG Family as a {!Contact.ATG_Title__c}, and we are enthusiastically looking forward to getting you involved across our portfolio of our monetization initiatives and solutions in the days ahead.  

As you know, you'll report up through {!Contact.ReportsToInfo__c},  with our {!Contact.ATG_Department_Updated__c} Team, however please know we are one family - and that everyone's door will be open to you.  The first few months with a company are commonly the most challenging, so don't ever hesitate to reach out to any one of us for questions, guidance, etc., as it's highly important to us at ATG we provide the proper support for new family members.  I know you only have the acquaintance of a few of us now, but starting with your orientation soon it should become much easier to build out new relationships across the company fairly quickly.  

With respect to the next couple of weeks, you will be receiving instructions for some prerequisite work in preparation for your upcoming New Hire Class.  We will work on getting you more face time with folks in the company as we get you more aligned to project and training opportunities in the next few weeks.  In the meantime, let me introduce a few ATG specialists who will be assisting with your on-boarding.  
•	{!Contact.Assigned_ESM__c}, your HR Specialist will be providing your ATG orientation over the next few days.  She will be connecting with you shortly to set up your orientation.  {!Contact.Assigned_ESM__c} works directly with myself as part of our Human Resources Team and if you can't reach her, I am always at your disposal if you need assistance.  
•	Kristin Mickey, Associate Director, Knowledge Management & Training, will be pivotal in you gaining more understanding about our company's approaches, methods, and tools.  We have a number of training programs ready for you with regard to ATG’s Hedgehog, our Monetization Ecosystem, CRM, CLM, Billing and CPQ essentials, as well as specific preparation for advanced training based on the focus and direction of your new functional role with ATG.  Kristen, {!Contact.ReportsToInfo__c}, {!Contact.Mentor__c} your ATG New Hire Mentor, who will help you navigate your initial 30 days with ATG have discussed your curriculum and Kristin is prepared to get you started.
 
As far as the {!Contact.ATG_Department_Updated__c} goes, I believe {!Contact.ReportsToInfo__c} is working on setting up a number of touch-points with you once you are on board, where you will get more details about your new team and your role with the company.  I might suggest the two of you find a few minutes to discuss any housekeeping items such as access to repositories, key meetings, as well as your computer needs throughout the course of your conversations.  

Again {!Contact.FirstName}, we are truly excited to have you on the ATG Team - Welcome Aboard!

David Mills, Vice President Human Resources
